    "text": "wtoc.com\nwebsite\nRichmond Hill\nWater line ‘accidentally cut by utility workers’ in Richmond Hill subdivision\nBy Summer Swanson,\n14 hours agoRICHMOND HILL, Ga. (WTOC) - The City of Richmond Hill announced that a water line in the Main Street subdivision was accidently cut by utility workers. Water was temporarily shut off in the affected area while repairs are underway. Areas that may be impacted:. • Ross Way. • Alexander Way.\n5",
